% Scenario: colorimage from one source per component. The three planes,
% procedures called in rotation, interleave into the same image as the
% single-source scenario; the sidecar golden is the same but for the
% resource order.
100 100 translate
50 50 scale
/r <FF0000FF> def /g <00FF00FF> def /b <0000FFFF> def
2 2 8 [2 0 0 -2 0 2] { r } { g } { b } true 3 colorimage
showpage
